<view class="page">
  <view class="title">人脸迎宾授权</view>
  <view class="desc">
    请正对前置摄像头实时采集，不读取相册图片。授权后到店可自动欢迎并推荐常点口味；可随时在会员中心关闭。
  </view>
  <camera
    wx:if="{{cameraOn}}"
    id="faceCamera"
    device-position="front"
    flash="off"
    class="camera"
  ></camera>
  <view class="hint" wx:if="{{cameraOn}}">请正对镜头，画面中仅本人一人</view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="startCamera" wx:if="{{!cameraOn}}">打开摄像头采集</button>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="captureAndConsent" wx:if="{{cameraOn}}" loading="{{uploading}}">拍照并授权</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="cancel">取消</button>
  </view>
</view>
